  "steps": [
    "Make a smooth mixture of curd, besan and spices mentioned above. Add water and mix again until there are no lumps. The consistency should be watery.",
    "In a pan, add ghee and then add curry leaves, mustard, hing, peppercorns, dried red chillies, green chillies, methi seeds and jeera.",
    "Sauté for 2 mins and add onion. Cook for 3-4 mins and then add spinach along with boiled soya chunks.",
    "Saute for 3-4 minutes and add the besan mixture.",
    "Cover and cook for 4-5 mins and add the ginger garlic paste along with jaggery powder. (You may add water if it seems too thick)",
    "Cover and cook again for 15 mins on low flame until the curry thickens a little.",
    "Garnish with coriander and serve with steaming hot basmati rice!"
  ],
